    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Nodosis</strong> is a game of<strong> Tic-Tac-Toe, </strong>where the only goal is to<strong> beat the score. Deckbuild</strong> and<strong> Create </strong>the<strong> ultimate machine, </strong>by generating<strong> X, Y </strong>or just raw<strong> Pointage</strong> though either<strong> powerful </strong>(secret)<strong>\u00a03-In-A-Row Combinations, Buffed </strong>and<strong> Synergized</strong> tiles or through the many<strong> rare </strong>and<strong> powerful Rings</strong> in the game, provided you can afford them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874580/extras/ed77501568f41c689ec5270adb0100ef.poster.avif?t=1754839225\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874580/extras/ed77501568f41c689ec5270adb0100ef.webm?t=1754839225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874580/extras/ed77501568f41c689ec5270adb0100ef.mp4?t=1754839225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-</strong> <strong>Replay\u00a0</strong>Tic-Tac-Toe over and over again... By <strong>traversing</strong> through a linear map <strong>scattered</strong> with <strong>tradeoffs</strong> and <strong>advantages</strong>. Every so often, you'll be personally <strong>challenged</strong>  by an Oculus Eye... A <strong>Boss</strong> of sorts. Each boss has their own unique <strong>gimmick</strong> and <strong>requirements</strong>, with even the game board itself <strong>changing</strong> shape into a <strong>4-4 grid</strong>?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#-----------\u00a0 \u00a0- GAME -\u00a0 ---|</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Different Tile Types!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple different Tile Variants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles and Bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Large Numbers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#------------\u00a0 \u00a0- INFO -\u00a0 ---|</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in development! I hope to release a <strong>Playable Demo</strong>\u00a0sometime this <strong>August</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo is to be released soon. </strong><i><u>Wishlist to stay informed!</u></i></p>",
