riants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles and Bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Large Numbers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#------------\u00a0 \u00a0- INFO -\u00a0 ---|</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in development! I hope to release a <strong>Playable Demo</strong>\u00a0sometime this <strong>August</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo is to be released soon. </strong><i><u>Wishlist to stay informed!</u></i></p>",
    "short_description": "Nodosis is a tic-tac-toe-inspired rogue-like deckbuilder where you play an endless game of high-scores, tile synergies and mysteriously accursed rings. Score, Retrigger, Multiply, Modify, Win and Lose. It's up to you how you want to play this game, Nodosis. Willing to take the chance?",
